# INVWINPR.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PANEC.CFG, a settings file that is not there, on the items of
# TEST/KEYS/PANEA.REQ with items 7 and 1 installed in item 5
# (TEST/KEYS/PANEC.REQ): one assembly, item 5, whose parts are two
# assemblies and a part of its own.  From the parts beside it, Take out
# on item 1 makes item 1 an assembly again, a row above item 5's: the
# assemblies, fetched again, still have item 5 selected, and the parts,
# which keep the focus, are still its.  Take out on item 7 there adds a
# row below, and item 5 stays.  With item 5's last part taken out item
# 5 is no assembly: the assemblies keep the row it had, item 7's now,
# and take the focus, the parts following to item 7's.  The end by
# Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPR.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/framchk.py
# checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I A
S ONE
K F6
S PARTS
K ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S ABOVE
K DOWN ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S BELOW
K ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S GONE
K ALT-F X
